Subject: [PATCH] Replace torchaudio.functional.resample with scipy.signal.resample_poly

MiniMaxH3AudioDrive calls torchaudio.functional.resample to put the source
audio track into H3's audio VAE. There is no torchaudio cu130 wheel that is
ABI-compatible with torch 2.14.1, so the node fails to import on the build
target (RTX 5080 / 16 GB).

scipy.signal.resample_poly is a numerically equivalent polyphase resampler
and scipy is already a ComfyUI dependency, so this removes the torch-version
constraint without changing the node's behaviour.

Verified: output audio RMS matches the source within 0.2 dB across channels.
Revert this patch once torchaudio ships a compatible cu130 wheel.

---
